E2 pre-unseal complete: projected-separation correction, 735 cal pairs, f~0 contamination, analysis frozen

Calibration caught a spec deviation (3D vs projected separation - radial
component is parallax-noise at these scales); corrected, both runs
preserved. Corrected calibration: vtilde_perp median 0.548, 1.9% above
sqrt(2) = pure-noise expectation (1.8+/-0.2%), El-Badry 88% with
non-overlaps characterized. Injection: screens kill 93% of triples;
residual f ~ 0 (<3%); even f=0.15 cannot fake a 20% boost. Pre-unseal
amendments frozen: primary = El-Badry-intersected subset; decision
statistic = median ratio low-a/high-a bins, symmetric reporting. Seal
unbroken; unseal awaits owner.

